~ capture
{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.captured_by]}}: [[There you are, {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}!|Stop right there, {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}!]] You're coming with me.
{{GlobalVars.sus_name}}: Alright, you got me.
Dispatcher: I heard from our field agent {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.captured_by]}} that {{GlobalVars.sus_name}} is now in custody.
Chief: Your team did well to bring in our suspect. Give agent {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.captured_by]}} a special thank you from the Sparta PD. If you have time, we could use your help with others.
- Yes, what can I do? (Play again)
	Chief: Great!
	do GlobalVars.play_again.emit()
- Quit
	Chief: [[I understand. Thanks, again.|Fine, I'm sure you have a lot of important stuff to do, like play video games.|You were a big help today. Maybe next time.]]
	=> END
